{% comment %}
================================================================================
CART ABANDON — "You May Also Like" Module
================================================================================
PURPOSE: Show 6 product recommendations (2×3 grid) based on the highest-value
         category in the user's most recent cart.

SIGNAL:  `top_cart_category` custom attribute (written by the existing Cart
          Viewed webhook). Format: "Furniture > Sofas" or "Furniture > Sectionals
          > Corner Sectionals". We extract L2 here and route to the matching
          Braze Content Block.

WHERE TO INSERT: In the Cart Abandon canvas email step, paste this block below
                 the main email body content (e.g. after the cart items table and
                 before the footer). The module renders nothing if the cart signal
                 is missing — no empty space left behind.

CONTENT BLOCKS REQUIRED (create via id_recommendation_blocks.py):
  id_recs_sofas, id_recs_sectionals, id_recs_chairs, id_recs_ottomans,
  id_recs_rugs, id_recs_dining_seating, id_recs_dining_tables, id_recs_beds,
  id_recs_accent_tables, id_recs_lighting, id_recs_art, id_recs_pillows,
  id_recs_benches

FALLBACK: If top_cart_category is blank or unrecognized, the entire module is
          suppressed ({% unless %} guard). No hardcoded fallback category is
          shown — a blank section is better than an irrelevant one for cart.
================================================================================
{% endcomment %}

{% comment %} ── Parse L2 from top_cart_category ──────────────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% assign top_cart_parts = custom_attribute.${top_cart_category} | split: ' > ' %}
{% assign rec_category   = top_cart_parts[1] | default: top_cart_parts[0] | default: '' %}

{% comment %} ── Render module only when we have a valid signal ─────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% unless rec_category == blank %}

{% comment %} ── Route to the matching content block ──────────────────────── {% endcomment %}
{% if rec_category == 'Sofas' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_sofas %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Sectionals' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_sectionals %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Chairs' or rec_category == 'Chair' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_chairs %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Ottomans' or rec_category == 'Ottoman' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_ottomans %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Rugs' or rec_category == 'Rug' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_rugs %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Dining Seating' or rec_category == 'Dining Chairs & Stools' or rec_category == 'Dining Chairs' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_dining_seating %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Dining Tables' or rec_category == 'Dining Table' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_dining_tables %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Beds' or rec_category == 'Bed' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_beds %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Tables' or rec_category == 'Coffee Tables' or rec_category == 'Accent Tables' or rec_category == 'Side Tables' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_accent_tables %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Lighting' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_lighting %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Artwork' or rec_category == 'Art' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_art %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Pillows' or rec_category == 'Throw Pillows' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_pillows %}
{% elsif rec_category == 'Benches' or rec_category == 'Bench' %}
  {% content_blocks.id_recs_benches %}
{% comment %} Unknown category — suppress rather than show wrong products {% endcomment %}
{% endif %}

{% endunless %}
